    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44374" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Singăra</span></b> , ōrum,
			n., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a city of Mesopotamia</i>, <i>the capital of
			the</i> Arabes Prætavi, <i><span class="en">Plin. 5, 24,
				21, § 86</span></i>.—Hence, adj.:
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Singărē-nus</span></b> , a, um, <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to
			Singara</i>: congressiones, Sext. <i><span class="en">Ruf. Brev.
				27</span></i>.</div>
